The entire narrative centers around the concept: "From silicon to strategy — a signal traveling through a chip."
*   Hero Canvas: A real-time WebGL "holographic silicon die" (a 3D interpretation of Holotech's chip icon). It features an iridescent teal (#3AD1C4) rim/fresnel glow, subtle holographic scanlines, and slight pointer parallax.
